{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:121e0477e9e7518bd81297dda22d87acd0eddcaa7b3983cb575f847b9e0e6467",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aecbc1aa9d75278e30c5a1849ad2c5980c5badf5d1ef5900cb7292ab227219",
      "text": "拍摄开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0019c96ac5b774eb37489c261105cc063d3409cf8d27a207d6e8358dac4630e6",
      "text": "拍摄，请多关照！\n……诶？要笑一笑……是、这种感觉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65bbdf3b22f6e45a8c18784538aa1e9fed49916bb2ef50617e751656fe3c520",
      "text": "唔——，表情可能有点僵硬。\n希望能笑得更自然一点哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f558e9709cb960f5eff5e78f685b74ed4c2af9c9754063af4acf7b430cb472e",
      "text": "自然的笑容？……这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a7cab97a977dc4f23926ee75a1fa59e5f963874317d3a6db6285f74cd00e2f",
      "text": "（可恶，脸都抽筋了！话说回来，奇怪？\n我平时到底是怎么笑来着……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42113d9e952be1946d868d6f92351a81d82557b124e0b94dbffc7e59e59e60f4",
      "text": "啊哈哈！冬马君未免也\n太僵硬了吧，简直像个机器人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f5eab7d8845fad236ccc946bb03d268eac6eb90333b37f964c50ca463135731",
      "text": "虽然自称唱歌很厉害，但宣传照？\n面对这种拍摄似乎还完全不行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43f763bdb711e3c2104fd0129daf421c4f3f23aed766bc10de41bc7dd6f78265",
      "text": "呵呵，那种青涩的地方，\n不也很符合新人偶像的风格嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8408ecefb97daab8c94376da912ed5a1eb7c7354f5e31ab82e657ab51330cc7a",
      "text": "总算结束了……\n光是拍个照片，就要消耗这么多体力吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c615b931bfbb4d7b013daaa94b870e8e84c6fa45aa7fe089d4073b9bfb6fe5",
      "text": "辛苦了，冬马。\n最后那部分表现得相当不错哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd7e0867b1429b2e40dd49c296c52477cd7b89217ccf4ed766a540392d9a84a0",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那是当然的啦！\n那么，接下来轮到谁拍了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91f265742fe78bba46e7a6619d348c9a540a88d842a80eb5fe44d8248e42fb24",
      "text": "好——的，轮到我了呢。\n……嘛，看好了哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
